# SPL Queries

## Successful logons (Event ID 4624)
---
* EventCode=4624
| stats count by Account_Name, Logon_Type
---
Shows which accounts log on successfully and how (interactive, network, remote desktop).

## Failed logons (Event ID 4625)
---
EventCode=4625
---
Shows failed logon attempts. Repeated failures from one source can indicate password guessing.
